{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794543171059,"sessionID":"ses_e2ce4c822ffeajVHIjUYYvzhCo","part":{"partID":"prt_1d31bb30b001U3keYQfSZeZyzn","sessionID":"ses_e2ce4c822ffeajVHIjUYYvzhCo","messageID":"msg_1d31baedb001YhxPo412nL1bEs","type":"tool","id":"call_d5539f3c6690409fa8a7cc64","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"awk '/^- \\[ \\] T004 /{print substr($0,1201,1110)}' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/012-plain-offer-reach/tasks.md","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"string): boolean { return GENERIC_REPAIR_CUE.test(prompt); }` with the doc comment `/** True when the prompt asks for a repair route without naming the problem. */`. (7) In the module header, replace `and if it does the advisor offers` and the line after it, `/doctor:helper, which then names the command.`, with `and if it does the advisor offers the command the ranker named, or` and `/doctor:helper when that command asks before it runs.`. In `DHT` add cases: `doctorProblemCue('my research loop stopped converging and I cannot see why')` is `'strong'`, `matchDoctorProblem('confirm the AGENTS.md sections in this repo have not drifted', WORKSPACE)?.runnable` is `'/doctor:agents-md check'`, `matchDoctorProblem('show me every GitHub Actions workflow and whether each is enabled', WORKSPACE)?.runnable` is `'/doctor:ci report'`, `genericRepairCue('I have a problem and want the right repair path suggested with reasons')` is true and `genericRepairCue('much appreciated, that fixed the problem completely')` is false. Verify: `VDHT` reports 0 failed, `TC` exits 0 and `rg -c \"stopped converg\" $DH` prints 1.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"string): boolean { return GENERIC_REPAIR_CUE.test(prompt); }` with the doc comment `/** True when the prompt asks for a repair route without naming the problem. */`. (7) In the module header, replace `and if it does the advisor offers` and the line after it, `/doctor:helper, which then names the command.`, with `and if it does the advisor offers the command the ranker named, or` and `/doctor:helper when that command asks before it runs.`. In `DHT` add cases: `doctorProblemCue('my research loop stopped converging and I cannot see why')` is `'strong'`, `matchDoctorProblem('confirm the AGENTS.md sections in this repo have not drifted', WORKSPACE)?.runnable` is `'/doctor:agents-md check'`, `matchDoctorProblem('show me every GitHub Actions workflow and whether each is enabled', WORKSPACE)?.runnable` is `'/doctor:ci report'`, `genericRepairCue('I have a problem and want the right repair path suggested with reasons')` is true and `genericRepairCue('much appreciated, that fixed the problem completely')` is false. Verify: `VDHT` reports 0 failed, `TC` exits 0 and `rg -c \"stopped converg\" $DH` prints 1.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"awk '/^- \\\\[ \\\\] T004 /{print substr($0,1201,1110)}' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/012-plain-offer-reach/tasks.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794543170315,"end":1794543171059}}}}
